## SELF-CHECK (run silently before emit)
1. Every backticked value, hash, IP, domain, tool name exists verbatim in the output above; no invented attribution or reputation stats.
2. All empty/absent fields omitted; same-type sets >5 consolidated.
3. One value or action per bullet; no label-only / self-evident / rule-restating bullets.
4. ≤2 Context bullets, each passing the interpretation/next-step test; no ROE/handling-rationale bullet; no intent/authorization non-finding ("telemetry didn't establish whether this was authorized/expected"); any "hunting/telemetry did not show X" claim reflects a query the output above actually ran — otherwise rendered as an explicit `[gap: ... not assessed]`, never as a clean result.
5. Trusted-binary suppressions applied; `File Name`=`Process` dupes dropped.
6. Risk explains THIS alert; mechanism = observed behavior; downstream = concrete consequence or explicit gap; sensor-honesty respected.
7. Correct typed VT link per public indicator; enrichment tools for relevant IOCs were executed within CORR; enrichment findings appended as `{Link} - {enrichment}` only where the output above produced them, bare link otherwise; RFC 1918 untouched.
8. MITRE ≤3, evidence-backed; no intent technique on benign-leaning; severity/technique consistent.
9. Priority line renders the level set above; closure offer present only where the disposition is expected/intent-dependent with no confirmed malice; no suppression language anywhere.
10. No preamble, no pre-draft pause, no trailing commentary, no question; recommended actions are inside the write-up, drive to a determination (concrete steps matched to the decisive artifact) and are not stacked "confirm whether approved" restatements; output is the single block.